|\n| Selling & Marketing Exp |       647.89 |       648.29 |       552.61 |       489.52 |\n| R&D Exp                 |      1995.96 |      2104.86 |      1465.75 |      1447.32 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |      1009.31 |      1042.29 |       720.29 |       763.39 |\n| Operating Income        |     10055.64 |      9093.72 |      8125.28 |      5947.22 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        14.34 |        12.63 |        13.41 |        13.91 |\n| Net Income              |      8341.04 |      8355.99 |      5031.75 |      5127.36 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        11.90 |        11.60 |         8.30 |        11.99 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |     -3658.47 |     10088.53 |      2230.85 |      4077.60 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |     -2055.86 |     -9143.18 |      -287.66 |      1116.50 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |      2824.14 |      -238.33 |      -414.02 |        55.14 |\n| CAPEX                   |     -1416.21 |     -1848.21 |      -710.37 |      -950.81 |"
